    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Kabalite Warriors",
    "summary": "When you pick this unit to fight in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) or to shoot in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), you may Empower it by spending 1 [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain).\n\nWhile it is Empowered, **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** of 1 may be re-rolled for its models' attacks. If the attack's target is in range of any objective marker, the whole [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) may be re-rolled instead.",
